# CLOUDFLARE PAGES DEPLOY EXCLUSIONS
#
# !!! `.gitignore` DOES NOT PROTECT A DEPLOY.  `wrangler pages deploy site`
# uploads what is on disk, not what is tracked, so a directory that is safely
# out of the repo can still be published to the open internet.  This file is
# what keeps it off.
#
# lookup_eval/ is 441 MB of dictionary data whose redistribution licences are
# unconfirmed (Abhidhāna, PEU, PPN) or which §9 excludes as a voice however it
# is licensed (DPD).  Publishing it would be exactly the thing the evaluation
# flag exists to prevent.  It is served from localhost only.
lookup_eval

# Working copies and backups that have accumulated beside the real files.
*.bak_*
*.pre*
*.prerebuild
*.prerepair
*.damaged_by_*
